    "measurementTechnique": [
      "Samples were collected at National Atmospheric Deposition Program sites using an Aerochem Metrics wet and dry sampler. The dry bucket contained a Dry Side Insert \"Brahney Bucket\" to capture dry deposited plastics. Wet deposition was filtered at the Central Analytical laboratory in Wisconsin and filters shipped to Utah State University for plastic processing. Dry samples were processed at Utah State University. Samples were collected from the glass base of the DSI using a ceramic razor blade into a pre-weighed container. Subsamples were counted and analyzed for plastic concentration and polymer composition. Data in the associated files are reported by deposition rate, calculated based on the sample area and the duration of sample acquisition. Dry and wet deposition rates are recorded as is, while the total deposition rates are corrected based on the blank determination. Note: only fibers were reported in lab, field, and process blanks."
    ],
